---
---
<section class="section" id="install">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-eyebrow" data-i18n="install.eyebrow">安装与运行</div>
      <h2 class="section-title" data-i18n="install.title">获取 ClipBar</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle" data-i18n="install.subtitle">支持通过 Homebrew Cask 安装，或直接下载 GitHub Releases 预编译包。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="install-cards-grid">
      <div class="install-option-card">
        <div class="install-card-body">
          <span class="install-badge brew" data-i18n="install.brew.badge">🍺 推荐方式</span>
          <h3 data-i18n="install.brew.title">Homebrew Cask</h3>
          <p data-i18n="install.brew.desc">通过 Lanrenwen Studio Tap 仓库一键安装，后续可通过 <code>brew upgrade</code> 保持更新：</p>
        </div>
        <div class="install-card-action">
          <button type="button" class="install-action-btn install-action-brew" data-copy="brew install --cask LanrenwenStudio/apps/clipbar" title="点击复制完整 Homebrew 安装命令">
            <div class="install-btn-left">
              <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="4 17 10 11 4 5"></polyline><line x1="12" y1="19" x2="20" y2="19"></line></svg>
              <code>brew install --cask clipbar</code>
            </div>
            <span class="copy-pill-hint">
              <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path></svg>
              <span>Copy</span>
            </span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="install-option-card">
        <div class="install-card-body">
          <span class="install-badge dmg" data-i18n="install.dmg.badge">⚡ 直接下载</span>
          <h3 data-i18n="install.dmg.title">macOS DMG 安装包</h3>
          <p data-i18n="install.dmg.desc">已通过 Apple Developer ID 签名与官方公证，下载后双击打开并将 ClipBar 拖入 <code>/Applications</code>：</p>
        </div>
        <div class="install-card-action">
          <a class="install-action-btn install-action-dmg" href="https://github.com/LanrenwenStudio/ClipBar/releases/latest/download/ClipBar.dmg" aria-label="下载最新 ClipBar.dmg">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"></polyline><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"></line></svg>
            <span data-i18n="install.dmg.button">下载最新 ClipBar.dmg</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
